  "citation": "Gajewski K; Viau A; Sawada M; Atkinson D; Wilson S (2002): Area and Carbon Content of Sphagnum Since Last Glacial Maximum. CDIAC. Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/VRC.001",
